# Staging: the app hosted in the dev Firebase project (https://vs-halo-drivers-ed-dev.web.app). Used by
# `npm run dev:staging` and by deploys, which build with `--mode staging`. Vite loads only this file in
# staging mode, not `.env.production`, so it holds the complete config. These values are compiled into
# the public site anyway; Firebase web config is not secret.
